            "content": "Each panel runs `EVAL \"return #redis.call('keys','<prefix>*')\" 0` and shows the integer.\n\nKEYS is O(N) and blocks the server while it runs. That is fine for the ~10k keys this homelab holds; do not reuse these panels against a much larger dataset \u2014 switch to SCAN there.\n\nTotals: `DBSIZE` in the row above."
